INDEX adapts the following MIT-licensed Korea100 components by Hoseong Seo:
https://github.com/hosungseo/korea100
Upstream revision: 948d43a73002862d02f908772586b55f9f32fdc6
Retrieved: 2026-11-07

Upstream snapshots are preserved in upstream/. LICENSE contains the complete MIT notice.
Adapted runtime files: src/archi/web/components/wiki/korea100/

RegistryCatalog: original catalog tree, responsive table/list, filters, comparison tray.
InstitutionDetailView: title/metric bands, section headings and one-page canvas structure.
DesktopProcessBoard: original grid, edge routing and node renderer (import and label adapter).
WikiWarroom: HUD header, document count, field rail, daily board, pipeline and ticker,
adapted from web/public/warroom/index.html.
CSS: original layout retained; palette and small text adapted for INDEX's dark theme.

INDEX replaces Next.js routing, static government catalog JSON and telemetry with its
existing wiki repository, Markdown documents, source IDs, version history and auth.
No government dataset, source-specific verification badge, site-specific branding,
or unrelated chris.gomdori.app code or artwork has been imported.
